<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Affliction Warlock</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-celestial-court">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pet_tigergodcub.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> The Celestial Court</span></h3>Chi-ji, Yu'Lon, Xuen, and Niuzao all share a loot pool and drop item level 553 Tier 16.<br/>
<br/>They also drop Prideful Gladiator PvP gear (ilvl 550), which fills off-slots with high ilvl items whilst you progress toward raids.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="ordos">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_axe_1h_firelandsraid_d_02.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Ordos, Fire God of the Yaungol</span></h3>Ordos drops plenty of decent pieces, such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105763/penates-perilous-pendant">
<img alt="Penate's Perilous Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace_mop6.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Penate's Perilous Pendant</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105789/bjams-blasting-bracers">
<img alt="Bjam's Blasting Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_cloth_raidmage_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bjam's Blasting Bracers</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105808/damiens-ice-vein-mask">
<img alt="Damien's Ice-Vein Mask" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_cloth_raidwarlock_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Damien's Ice-Vein Mask</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105797/shay-niis-popping-shoulderpads">
<img alt="Shay-Nii's Popping Shoulderpads" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_cloth_raidmage_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shay-Nii's Popping Shoulderpads</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105757/shipleys-shady-silks">
<img alt="Shipley's Shady Silks" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_cloth_raidwarlock_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shipley's Shady Silks</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105773/ulmaas-robes-of-crushing-magma">
<img alt="Ulmaas' Robes of Crushing Magma" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_raidmage_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ulmaas' Robes of Crushing Magma</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105781/venrukis-venerable-sash">
<img alt="Venruki's Venerable Sash" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_cloth_raidmage_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Venruki's Venerable Sash</span></a>. These are fairly rare, but can be nice items until you obtain your Celestial gear. <br/>
<br/>Access to Ordos is strictly gated behind the Legendary Cloak questline. You must have the cloak (or have completed the quest on your account) to enter the sanctuary and receive loot.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops-2">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_staff_2h_pandarenmonk_c_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Timeless Isle Items for Affliction Warlock</span></h2>The Timeless Isle in Phase 5 is a great place to catch up on gear. You will earn <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=777/timeless-coin">
<span>
<img alt="Timeless Coin" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/timelesscoin.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Coin</span></span></a> for almost all activities that you participate in. <br/>
<br/>This can be used to buy <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=104013/timeless-cloth-armor-cache">
<img alt="Timeless Cloth Armor Cache" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_23_netherweave.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Cloth Armor Cache</span></a>, which rewards the player with a piece of gear, depending on the loot specialization they currently have selected, that ranges from a 496 item level to a 535 (lower chance).<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="trinkets">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_03.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Affliction Warlock Pre-Raid Trinkets in Phase 5</span></h2>
<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="best-trinkets">Best Trinkets</h5>While the specific type of trinket (active vs. passive) isn't overly critical for Warlocks, passive trinkets are inherently easier to use and maintain uptime on, making them ideal for players who may forget to use actives or have inconsistent cooldown alignment.<br/>
<br/>
<ins>Passive Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=104924/purified-bindings-of-immerseus">
<img alt="Purified Bindings of Immerseus" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Purified Bindings of Immerseus</span></a> is the definitive best-in-slot trinket for all Warlock specializations in Phase 5. It provides a massive amount of static Intellect and a unique passive effect that amplifies your Haste, Mastery, and Critical Strike from all sources by a percentage. Because it scales with your other gear, it increases the value of every other piece of equipment you own.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105150/black-blood-of-yshaarj">
<img alt="Black Blood of Y'Shaarj" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Black Blood of Y'Shaarj</span></a> is one of the strongest trinkets. It offers an Intellect proc that increases in power every second for 10 seconds.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="legendary-cloak">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_legendary_theblackprince.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Legendary Cloak for Affliction Warlock</span></h2>With the removal of Raid Finder in Mists of Pandaria Classic, it is possible to earn your Legendary Cloak without ever setting foot into a raid. This can be done inside Celestial Dungeons.  <br/>
<br/>In Phase 5, you can at last finish the Legendary Quest Line and earn your Legendary Cloak. <a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=102246/xing-ho-breath-of-yulon">
<img alt="Xing-Ho, Breath of Yu'lon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_pandaria_dragoncaster_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Xing-Ho, Breath of Yu'lon</span></a> is the legendary caster cloak in Mists of Pandaria. Its proc contributes approximately 3% of total DPS.<br/>
<br/>The damage dealt by this proc is categorized as a direct hit, meaning it can trigger damage-based effects (such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96558/unerring-vision-of-lei-shen">
<img alt="Unerring Vision of Lei Shen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_focusedaim.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unerring Vision of Lei Shen</span></a>).<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Affliction Warlock</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="emperor-shaohao">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Emperor Shaohao</span></h3>
<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>Emperor Shaohao is a new faction introduced on the Timeless Isle. This faction is purely for vanity loot only, including <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87774/reins-of-the-heavenly-golden-cloud-serpent">
<img alt="Reins of the Heavenly Golden Cloud Serpent" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pandarenserpentgodmount_gold.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reins of the Heavenly Golden Cloud Serpent</span></a>. However, there is no worthwhile gear to chase.<br/>
<br/>
