<del></del></span> Best Crafted Gear for Affliction Warlocks</span></h2>Although not very powerful when compared to other options that are available mid-way through Phase 5, there are a few crafted items that can help you get started in your gearing journey. Allowing you to queue into Heroic and Celestial Dungeons faster:<ul class="exclude-units">
